name c01m03-tactical-run
timeout 600
time 1992-10-29T19:20:00Z

# COMANCHE: MAXIMUM OVERKILL (NovaLogic 1992), CAMPAIGN ONE "OPERATION MAXIMUM OVERKILL",
# MISSION 3 OF 10 -- {Tactical Run} [MIS].
# Spec, provenance and every open question: mods/comanche/doc/campaign.md, terrain.md,
# substitutions.md, hud.md. Format: doc/missions/syntax.md.
#
# THE TASK [MIS]: "destroy the fuel tanks" -- 5 of 17 objects, on 6 000 fuel, alone, from a start
# line the file gives as 0,0,0: the map corner, 8.3 km from the nearest goal. Recorded as measured;
# whether the engine reads that as "no start given" is unknown (campaign.md 7).
#
# THE FIELD [MIS]: map 2 (Canyonlands, Utah, terrain.md 6), day -- sun +37.89 deg at the lead's
# spawn, computed by the runner. 5 starred objects, unlock marker none - open from the start.
# THE CAST: 4 Werewolf -> `ah64` - 6 T-80 -> `target_hard` - 5 fuel tank -> `target_soft` - 2
# Gecko -> `sa8`.
# THE LOADOUT [MIS]: cannon 500, rockets 62, Hellfire 6, Stinger 10, artillery 0, wingman 0, fuel
# 6000. Declared here: 4 x `mk82`, 4 x `aim9`, gun 500, `set fuel_int_pct 30` = 6000 against the
# campaign's own maximum of 20 000. The rockets and the artillery have no row and no mechanism;
# the truncation of the other two is the F-16's nine pylons.

# ---- THE SEVEN DISCLOSURES ARE STATED IN FULL IN c01m01-werewolves-on-patrol.fbm AND APPLY HERE
# ---- UNCHANGED: D1 no rotorcraft (the RAH-66 flies as `module f16`, 300 kt because 180-275 kt crash
# ---- the egress) - D2 the Werewolf is an `ah64` mover and fires nothing, ever - D3 flat 0 m ground,
# ---- because one mod carries one DEM and this campaign needs four theatres - D4 the clock is checked
# ---- against the logged sun elevation - D5 the anchoring is terrain.md's reconstruction and the
# ---- campaign names no place - D6 the striker spawns on the bearing to its aim point, because the
# ---- attack phase cannot fly itself onto its own run-in - D7 one striker is one aim point.
#
# READING RULE (binding). The verdict is `lead`'s.
#   SUCCESS/exit 0 requires all 5 fuel tanks destroyed ON 6 000 FUEL. Running dry short of the target
#   would be a mission loss; reaching the target with fuel to spare at a lower throttle setting than
#   the model allows would be an engine defect. MEASURED: neither happens, because the campaign's fuel
#   figure has no decoded unit and the only defensible mapping is the RATIO against the campaign's own
#   maximum (6 000 / 20 000 = 30 % internal). At 30 % the F-16 burns 2 091 -> 1 506 lbs over the whole
#   600 s run with no BINGO and no warning. The mission's defining constraint is therefore NOT
#   REPRODUCED, and that is a statement about the substitute's fuel fraction, not about the mission.
#   exit 3 = the expected reading; report the met count.

# MEASURED (exit 3, `--elev const`): ONE OF FIVE.
#   t = 56.8 s          one Mk-82 away, aimErrM 9.75; f03 destroyed
#   fuel                2 091.49 -> 1 506.43 lbs over 600 s. No BINGO, no warning (see the rule above)
#   verdict             `lead` TIMEOUT, 1 of 5 met, `survive` met. 12 SA-8 launches, closest 13.21 m
#                       against a 6 m fuze -- two near misses that a metre of geometry would flip.

unit lead
  module f16
  team friendly
  flight m03 1
  spawn 38.23524 -109.94380 150 145.9 300
  set gear up
  set fuel_int_pct 30
  set datalink on
  set fcr_mode off
  set rwr on
  set store 3 mk82
  set store 4 mk82
  set store 6 mk82
  set store 7 mk82
  set store 1 aim9
  set store 2 aim9
  set store 8 aim9
  set store 9 aim9
  set gun_rounds 500
  set cmds_mode auto
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set task attack
  set attack_mode ccrp
  wp 38.17882 -109.89522 150 300
  wp 38.15155 -109.87174 1000 300
  objective kill unit f01
  objective kill unit f02
  objective kill unit f03
  objective kill unit f04
  objective kill unit f05
  objective survive

unit t01
  module target_hard
  team hostile
  spawn 38.17135 -109.89465 ground 0.0 0

unit t02
  module target_hard
  team hostile
  spawn 38.17135 -109.89465 ground 45.0 0

unit t03
  module target_hard
  team hostile
  spawn 38.17135 -109.89465 ground 90.0 0

unit g01
  module sa8
  team hostile
  spawn 38.17135 -109.89465 ground 135.0 0

unit t04
  module target_hard
  team hostile
  spawn 38.17135 -109.89465 ground 180.0 0

